==Battleground==
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*10 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hermit Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Alpacky]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Hermit Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this Stage has a Lot of Variants of [[Jackie Peng]] it is recommended to put at Minimum 2 meatshields in your loadout. If you have any Treasures from Cats of the Cosmos, [[Star Peng]] will become a joke as His 100% Magnification isnt very high. Make Sure to only Push at full strength. Otherwise the [[Alpacky]] will get in your way.

